From: Mesh-LLM CI <ci@mesh-llm.local>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] skippy: annotate dots1 graph semantics

Generated by tools/skippy-stage-rewriter from compiler-proven builder
shapes. Auxiliary sidecars and whole-model multi-domain graphs are proven
separately and remain outside the primary decoder stage interval.

---
diff --git a/src/models/dots1.cpp b/src/models/dots1.cpp
index f29f669c21f0add4015240ad521e2ebcd971cb65..2a796ee9f582d11a00847058c330c7f5b7fdf174 100644
--- a/src/models/dots1.cpp
+++ b/src/models/dots1.cpp
@@ -91,6 +91,8 @@ llama_model_dots1::graph::graph(const llama_model & model, const llm_graph_param
     ggml_tensor * inp_out_ids = build_inp_out_ids();
 
     for (int il = 0; il < n_layer; ++il) {
+        begin_block(inpL, il);
+
         ggml_tensor * inpSA = inpL;
 
         // norm
@@ -175,6 +177,7 @@ llama_model_dots1::graph::graph(const llama_model & model, const llm_graph_param
 
         // input for next layer
         inpL = cur;
+        end_block(inpL, il);
     }
     cur = inpL;
 
